<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches played</p>
<p>in the German league championship on Saturday:</p>
<p> Duisburg			 3   Borussia Dortmund  2</p>
<p> Schalke			  1   Werder Bremen	1</p>
<p> VfB Stuttgart		  5   Hansa Rostock	1</p>
<p> Borussia Moenchengladbach  4   Freiburg	     3</p>
<p> St Pauli			 0   1860 Munich	  0</p>
<p> Bayern Munich		  3   Cologne		2</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p> Arminia Bielefeld	    1   Hamburg		1</p>
<p> Bayer Leverkusen	     3   Karlsruhe	    1</p>
<p>Playing on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bochum v Fortuna Duesseldorf</p>
</text>
